t=\"Custom soccer jersey — AEK Heritage Floral\" class=\"trust-card-img\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<div class=\"trust-card-overlay\">\n<div class=\"trust-card-team\">AEK</div>\n<div class=\"trust-card-desc\">Heritage Floral. White elegance with burgundy &amp; gold.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"trust-card\">\n<div class=\"trust-card-img-wrap\"><img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/pics/646b2d9eeef70514c4ed53899a84c2755489d78d2ae484f66660e4d14fd15c16.png\" alt=\"Custom soccer jersey — Les Défonceurs\" class=\"trust-card-img\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<div class=\"trust-card-overlay\">\n<div class=\"trust-card-team\">LES DÉFONCEURS</div>\n<div class=\"trust-card-desc\">Claw Strike. Red &amp; black combat-sport aggression.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"trust-card\">\n<div class=\"trust-card-img-wrap\"><img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/pics/f8e75a66d23a34b4bf24c153ada54731ea34488c0a416bf016d7183408f9da6b.png\" alt=\"Custom soccer jersey — KINGS Shadow Dragon\" class=\"trust-card-img\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<div class=\"trust-card-overlay\">\n<div class=\"trust-card-team\">KINGS</div>\n<div class=\"trust-card-desc\">Shadow Dragon. Black-on-black luxury with gold crown.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"trust-card\">\n<div class=\"trust-card-img-wrap\"><img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/pics/2572b5c39f8cbcf5e4d530fcfd8f86e55c1e969b7c9d95088180fb508e6c54b6.png\" alt=\"Custom soccer jersey — Pecados Capitales Duality\" class=\"trust-card-img\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<div class=\"trust-card-overlay\">\n<div class=\"trust-card-team\">PECADOS CAPITALES</div>\n<div class=\"trust-card-desc\">Duality. Angels &amp; demons in red, black &amp; gold.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"trust-cta\"><a href=\"/pages/request-custom-kit-design\" class=\"trust-btn-primary\">Request Free Design</a> <a href=\"/pages/custom-kit-gallery\" class=\"trust-btn-secondary\">Explore 500+ Custom Soccer Jersey Designs →</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"sj-container\"><!-- COMPARISON -->\n<h2 class=\"sj-h2\">How MOMUTO Compares</h2>\n<p class=\"sj-p\">A side-by-side look at MOMUTO versus the way most teams get custom soccer uniforms today — a local print shop or a traditional bulk supplier.</p>\n<div class=\"sj-table-wrap\">\n<div class=\"table-scroll-wrapper\" style=\"overflow-x: auto;\">\n<table class=\"sj-table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Factor</th>\n<th>MOMUTO</th>\n<th>Local Print Shop</th>\n<th>Traditional Bulk Supplier</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Minimum Order</td>\n<td>1 unit</td>\n<td>Often 1–6</td>\n<td>Usually 10–hundreds</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Decoration</td>\n<td>Full dye-sublimation (printed into the fabric)</td>\n<td>Heat-press / vinyl numbers</td>\n<td>Sewn-on twill / embroidery</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Design Freedom</td>\n<td>Unlimited colors, gradients, patterns, crests</td>\n<td>Limited by transfer area</td>\n<td>Limited by stitching</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Crest &amp; Patches</td>\n<td><span class=\"sj-check\">✓</span> Sublimated, full color, no extra cost</td>\n<td>Add-on cost</td>\n<td>Embroidery surcharge</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Per-player Names &amp; Numbers</td>\n<td><span class=\"sj-check\">✓</span> Included</td>\n<td>Per-name charge</td>\n<td>Per-name charge</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Youth &amp; Adult Sizes</td>\n<td><span class=\"sj-check\">✓</span> Both, same design</td>\n<td>Varies</td>\n<td>Varies</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Design Help</td>\n<td>Free 3D tool + free pro designer</td>\n<td>You supply artwork</td>\n<td>You supply artwork</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fabric</td>\n<td>Polyester-elastane performance blend</td>\n<td>Blank stock tees</td>\n<td>100% polyester (typical)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Turnaround</td>\n<td>25–30 days</td>\n<td>Days–weeks (simple jobs)</td>\n<td>4–6+ weeks</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"sj-note\">General comparison of common options for US teams. Local print shops can be faster for very simple, low-color jobs; MOMUTO's advantage is full-color custom design with no minimum and per-player personalization built in. For named brands, see <a href=\"/pages/best-custom-soccer-jersey-makers-2026\" style=\"color: #a1a1aa; text-decoration: underline;\">best custom soccer jersey makers 2026</a>.</p>\n<!-- USE CASES -->\n<h2 class=\"sj-h2\">Built for Every Kind of Team</h2>\n<div class=\"sj-uc-grid\">\n<div class=\"sj-uc\"><i class=\"fas fa-shield-halved\"></i>\n<h3>Club Teams</h3>\n<p>Match and away kits with your crest, sponsors, and full squad of names and numbers.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sj-uc\"><i class=\"fas fa-children\"></i>\n<h3>Youth &amp; Academy</h3>\n<p>One design across every age group, in youth and adult sizing, with no minimum order. See <a href=\"/pages/custom-youth-club-soccer-uniforms\" style=\"color: #fff; text-decoration: underline;\">youth &amp; club uniforms</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sj-uc\"><i class=\"fas fa-futbol\"></i>\n<h3>Rec &amp; Adult Leagues</h3>\n<p>Outfit a 5-a-side, 7-a-side, or weekend league side — order just what you need.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sj-uc\"><i class=\"fas fa-graduation-cap\"></i>\n<h3>College &amp; Intramural</h3>\n<p>Club and intramural teams get a pro look without a federation-sized budget or order.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sj-uc\"><i class=\"fas fa-briefcase\"></i>\n<h3>Corporate &amp; Events</h3>\n<p>Company sides, tournaments, and charity matches with branded jerseys for everyone.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sj-uc\"><i class=\"fas fa-shirt\"></i>\n<h3>Goalkeeper &amp; Training</h3>\n<p>Matching goalkeeper jerseys and training tops designed in the same kit system.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- FAQ -->\n<h2 class=\"sj-h2\">Soccer Jersey FAQ</h2>\n<div class=\"sj-faq\">\n<details>\n<summary>Is there a minimum order for custom soccer jerseys?</summary>\n<p>No. MOMUTO has no minimum order — order a single custom jersey or a full club kit of 100+. Pricing per jersey drops as the order grows, but there are no minimum-quantity surcharges or sample fees.</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>How long does delivery take?</summary>\n<p>Custom soccer jerseys and uniforms are delivered in 25–30 days worldwide (production plus shipping direct from the factory). Your free design mockup is ready in 1–2 days, and production doesn't start until you approve it.</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Can I upload my own logo or team crest?</summary>\n<p>Yes. Upload your club logo, crest, or sponsor artwork and our design team places it on the jersey. Because every kit is full dye-sublimation printed, logos and crests are printed into the fabric — no size or color limits, and no peeling.</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>What sizes are available — do you make youth soccer jerseys?</summary>\n<p>Yes. MOMUTO makes both youth and adult sizes, so a club, academy, or family can order the same design across every age group. A full size guide with measurements is available before you order.</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Are the jerseys sublimated or sewn?</summary>\n<p>All MOMUTO soccer jerseys use full dye-sublimation printing, where the design is fused into the fabric. It never peels, cracks, or fades, and it allows unlimited colors, gradients, patterns, names, numbers, and crests at no extra cost — unlike sewn-on twill or heat-pressed numbers.</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Can each player have a different name and number?</summary>\n<p>Yes. The whole team can order one design with a different name and number per player at no extra charge. Personalization is part of the print, not an add-on.</p>\n</details>\n</div>\n<!-- CTA --></div>\n<div class=\"sj-cta-block\">\n<h2>Start Your Soccer Kit</h2>\n<p>Design it yourself in 3D, or let our team design it for you — free, with no commitment until you order.</p>\n<a href=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/configurator.html?userId=userIdUrl&amp;configId=ypi9qc1z&amp;suitName=mamuto3suit1&amp;lang=en&amp;langguage=en\" class=\"sj-btn\">Design in 3D</a> <a href=\"/pages/request-custom-kit-design\" class=\"sj-btn secondary\">Request a Free Design</a>\n<p class=\"sj-note\">No minimum order · Full sublimation · Youth to adult sizes · Worldwide delivery in 25–30 days</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
